<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kumpulan Fima debut at 3.30 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kumpulan Fima debut at 3.30 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian diversified group Kumpulan Fima Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Friday at 3.30 ringgit, compared with an offer price of 2.10 ringgit.</p>
<p>At 0147 GMT, the stock was trading at 3.60 ringgit on a volume of 4.59 million shares.</p>
</text>
